  - List row "Ideas", → toggle (on)
- Grid (3 columns)
  - Primary button "A"
  - Primary button "B"
- Text "Hello"
- Shape (rectangle)
- List row "Bottom nav", → chevron (opens a screen) — pinned to bottom
- Primary button "+" — floating, bottom left
"
